+"""Tests for Exp5964 SOTA atom compatibility corpus.
+
+Spec refs: REQ-INFER-SOTA-5964, SCENARIO-INFER-SOTA-5964-BLOCKED,
+SCENARIO-INFER-SOTA-5964-CORPUS, SCENARIO-INFER-SOTA-5964-CONTROLS.
+"""
